This package includes the SunSpec information model definitions published
by the SunSpec Alliance in https://github.com/sunspec/models, licensed under
the Apache License, Version 2.0 (LICENSE-models). They are carried in
src/models.ts (dist/models.js once built), written from the JSON files of
that repository by scripts/models.mjs, which keeps their names, types,
sizes, scale factors, units, access, counts, labels and symbol names, and
leaves out their descriptions, details, comments and standards.

SunSpec is a trademark of the SunSpec Alliance. This package is not
certified by the SunSpec Alliance.

The test fixtures device_1547.json and inverter_123.json are written from
the test data of pysunspec2 (https://github.com/sunspec/pysunspec2,
Apache License 2.0) by tests/fixtures/make-fixtures.py, with the values
pysunspec2 computes from them.
